('HCP-26-167', 109, NULL, 'Person Related', '35', 9, 'HELLO SHAHANA, SHADAB GAVE ME DETAILS OF MR RAVI MARWAHA TO BOOK HOME COLLECTION WHICH I BOOKED BUT SHADAB DID NOT INFORM ME THAT WE DON\'T TAKE HOME COLLECTION CHARGE FROM THIS PATIENT LOCATED IN (M-BLOCK GK-2) WHEN I CALLED YOU TO CHECK THIS, YOU STARTED SHOUTING WITHOUT EVEN LISTENING TO ME. I DID WHAT IS OUR PROCESS STANDARD PROCEDURE. IT WAS NOT MENTIONED IN THE BOOKING NOT TO TAKE HOME COLLECTION. WITH DUE RESPECT, WE LOOK UPTO YOU AS A MANAGER, SHOUTING & YELLING DOES NOT MAKE ANY MANAGER EFFECTIVE & EFFICIENT.  ', NULL, NULL, 35, 'I had already shared the required details with Shadab and informed him that the patient is an old company patient and that the collection was urgent. The information regarding non-applicability of home collection charges for M-Block GK-2 was not communicated to me at that time.\nAs this was not mentioned or not update to you during booking, I proceeded as per the standard SOP. The total bill amount was 1100/ (more than 1000/), and as per company policy, home collection charges are not applicable for amounts above 1000/. The delay occurred due to a communication gap and not due to any oversight.', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-02-20 12:52:34', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-03 11:31:02', '2026-02-20 12:52:34', 'Pending', NULL, 'Training Need', 0, 0, 'Suresh Kundra', 'Shahana Parveen', 'Shahana Parveen', 'Marketing', 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, 1),
('HCP-26-168', 91, NULL, 'Person Related', '106', 7, 'PLEASE ENSURE  THAT THE GROSSING ROOM IS CLEANED', NULL, NULL, 106, 'SORRY', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-02-04 12:45:55', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-03 14:03:12', '2026-02-04 12:45:55', 'Pending', NULL, 'Negligence', 0, 0, 'A . Sylvia', 'Akshay Kumar Ram', 'Akshay Kumar Ram', 'House Keeping', 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
('HCP-26-169', 2, NULL, 'Person Related', '40', 9, 'I would like to raise a concern regarding the payment follow-up . Despite multiple follow-ups and reminders, Mr. Gunjan has not provided any update on the payment status.\r\nThis delay is impacting our process, and we would appreciate an immediate update or clarification on the expected timeline.', NULL, NULL, 40, 'SORRY FOR DELAY , ACTUALY TWO THREE CLIENTS IS NOT GIVING PROPER ANSWER THATS WHY I AM LATE.', 'Closed', 125, 'Lack of Training / Knowledge, Misunderstanding of Process / SOP', 'Explained him the process in depth.', 'Done', '2026-02-12 19:53:35', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-03 14:42:07', '2026-02-12 19:53:35', 'Pending', NULL, 'Process Gap', 0, 0, 'Rohit Kumar Pandey', 'Gunjan mehta', 'Gunjan mehta', 'Marketing', 0, 1, 1, 0, 125, 1),
('HCP-26-170', 35, NULL, 'Person Related', '2256', 6, 'Needs to hire a responsible and punctual field staff ie technicians.Today the technician was scheduled to collect sample for the ppbs @Pt Vimlesh but he couldn’t turned up.He phoned me at about 10 AM after a delay of one hour.Take necessary steps against such a irresponsible behaviour.Hope it will not happen in future.\r\n\r\nPT NAME- VIMLESH', NULL, NULL, 2256, 'Sorry traffic bhot jada tha or distance 37 min direction time tha  patient mne fixed time confm nhi kia tha....Sorry for my mistake mene Inform nhi kia lab m.', 'Closed', 125, NULL, NULL, 'closed', '2026-02-20 13:05:51', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-03 15:19:56', '2026-02-20 13:05:51', 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Shahana Parveen', 'Narendra Pal', 'Narendra Pal', 'Home Collection Phlebo', 0, 1, 0, 0, 2262, 0),
