('HCP-26-174', 133, NULL, 'Person Related', '2250', 3, 'SHE ASKED ME TO FIND OUT THE SAMPLE FROM PREVIOUS  DATE [30/01/2026 ID 10264465] AND I GOT BUT SHE HAS NOT TAKE ANY QUERY TO THIS SAMPLE FOR ME AND SHE IS NOT HANDOVER TO THIS CASE ANYONE AND SHE\'S AWAY WITHOUT GIVING ANY INFORMATION ', NULL, NULL, 2250, 'I COULD NOT FIND THE ID SECOND THING THE PATIENT WHO HAD CONCERN FOR ADD ON TEST SHE DIDNT RESPONDED ON CALL OR WHATSAPP EVEN ON API MESSAGES TOO .I WAS KEEP IN TRYING TO BE IN TOUCH WITH THAT PATIENT BUT PATIENT WAS NOT RESPONDING AND I APPOLOGISE FOR THE SAME \nMY SHIFT WAS 7AM TO 5PM ON 3/02/2026', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-02-20 13:04:38', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-03 19:41:59', '2026-02-20 13:04:38', 'Pending', NULL, 'Negligence', 0, 0, 'Harshit', 'Prerna Sharma', 'Prerna Sharma', 'Customer Care', 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, 1),
('HCP-26-175', 2262, NULL, 'Person Related', '109', 3, 'The patient was told that we would send a 24-hour urine container to them, but it was not mentioned anywhere that a 24-hour container would be sent. Because of this, Mr. Atish had to wait, and all the collections started late. Please take care of such things, as it causes a lot of problems for the phlebotomist.', NULL, NULL, 109, 'I accept my mistake, I should have mentioned it in the booking..', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-02-20 13:05:04', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-04 09:30:35', '2026-02-20 13:05:04', 'Pending', NULL, 'Negligence', 0, 0, 'Shadab Ali', 'Suresh Kundra', 'Suresh Kundra', 'Customer Care', 0, 1, 1, 0, NULL, 1),
