('HCP-26-255', 2262, NULL, 'Person Related', '147', 3, 'You mentioned the wrong patient number in the booking. Because of that, the phlebotomist had to run around and the slot was wasted. It had to be cancelled, and later the patient called and complained that the phlebotomist did not come. Please take care in the future.', NULL, NULL, 147, 'Sorry that no.was new there was error in 4 instead of 2 will be careful on verbal communication while entering it.', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-02-20 21:28:06', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-15 10:55:45', '2026-02-20 21:28:06', 'Pending', NULL, 'Negligence', 0, 0, 'Shadab Ali', 'jyoti', 'jyoti', 'Customer Care', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
('HCP-26-256', 23, NULL, 'Person Related', '161', 4, 'aapki 11 bje ki duty time h or aap bol rhe ho ki m nhi aa paunga meri bike kharab ho gyi matlab aapko bhi pta hona chahiye ki sunday ke din staff kam hota h or aap 11 baje bata rhe ho ', NULL, NULL, 161, 'Bike office aate hue raste m 11 bje khrb hui hai to msg kya 1 din phle daalta\nItna to aap logo ko malum hona chahiye ki chhutti lene ka plan hota h to phle inform Kiya jata hai jb koi plan hi nhi tha chhutti lene ka to phle se kaise inform kar deta jis waqt bike khrb hui usi waqt msg daal diya.\nAgr msg na dalta or nc lagti to samajh m bhi aata mne to msg bhi daal diya phir bhi nc lgadi.', 'Responded', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-15 11:37:59', '2026-03-01 18:42:27', 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Keshav', 'Khubaib Khan', 'Khubaib Khan', 'Field', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
('HCP-26-257', 23, NULL, 'Person Related', '69', 4, ' Moin aapko ek home collection ko bola tha phir bolte h ki meri bike puncture h collection karne ke baad bolte h Mera dar dard ho rha h moin aapse maine bola tha aap abhi rest kr lijiye aap bolte h mujhe ghar jana h aapko pata h aaj staff nhi h Phir bhi aap ghar chale gye', NULL, NULL, 69, 'Sir meri bike puncher thi tabhi bola tha fir bhi main hi puncher bike lekar collection pr gya tha uske bad meri tabiyat kharab ho gyi thi to sir main kaise kaam karta ye batao aap jayada hi problem lag rahi thi muje Varna majn nhi jata sir  Varna muje sir kaunsa shauk tha ghar jane ka sir sorry sir meri wajah se aap ke agr koi kaam me dikkat ayi ho', 'Responded', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-15 12:47:31', '2026-03-01 18:42:27', 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Keshav', 'Mohd moin husain', 'Mohd moin husain', 'Field Operations', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
('HCP-26-258', 7, NULL, 'Person Related', '2262', 6, '	8076640554	sarvesh /	Delhi	C-1 third floor hukumchand apartment gate number 3 Kishangarh near by Parveen Patanjali Store vasant,,,,VASANT KUNJ,\r\nC/O PRIYANKA Collection timing 1:00-1:30 pm ,priyanka request you to  send technician early u said ok, she remind you twice but collection not done till 2:15 pm and collection cancelled . ', NULL, NULL, 2262, 'Regarding patient Sarvesh, as soon as I was informed by Priyanka ma’am that the collection needed to be done early, I immediately messaged the phlebotomist. The original collection timing was 01:00 PM to 01:30 PM. The phlebotomist had spoken to the patient at 8:00 AM, but I received the intimation in the group at 1:23 PM. After that, I changed the timing and reassigned the collection to someone else.\nI apologize for the inconvenience. I should not have tried to coordinate only through messages. Going forward, I will ensure that such complaints do not happen again.\nI do not have any personal grudge or issue with anyone in the lab.', 'Responded', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-15 14:40:09', '2026-03-01 18:42:27', 'Pending', NULL, 'Negligence', 0, 0, 'Ritu Mahalwal', 'Shadab Ali', 'Shadab Ali', 'Home Collection Phlebo', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
('HCP-26-259', 7, NULL, 'Person Related', '173', 6, '	8076640554	sarvesh /	Delhi	C-1 third floor hukumchand apartment gate number 3 Kishangarh near by Parveen Patanjali Store vasant,,,,VASANT KUNJ,\r\ncollection timing 1:00-1:30 pm but you call patient in morning 8am to confirm time . There is no need to call patient at this time . ', NULL, NULL, 173, 'This is my mistake I\'ll take care next time', 'Closed', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ok', '2026-02-20 21:30:51', 0, NULL, 0, '2026-02-15 14:42:49', '2026-02-20 21:30:51', 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 'Ritu Mahalwal', 'Abhay Pratap Singh', 'Abhay Pratap Singh', 'Home Collection Phlebo', 0, 1, 0, 0, NULL, 0),
